This client talks to a MeshCentral server using the same control-channel messages as the
MeshCentral web interface. Where present, the account and device permission rules follow the web
interface functions GetMeshRights, GetNodeRights and removeUserRights, and option labels and bit
values match the web interface. The remote desktop view embeds the MeshCentral web viewer served
by the user's own MeshCentral server at run time; it is not copied into this project.
